{"duration_api_ms": 39561, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "3a132307-024a-4aa3-aca3-14420f543c2b", "total_cost_usd": 0.11202967500000001, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3551, "cache_read_input_tokens": 59554, "output_tokens": 620, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3551, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 448, "cache_read_input_tokens": 30492, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2121, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2121}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-sonnet-5-5": {"inputTokens": 10, "outputTokens": 1941, "cacheReadInputTokens": 127645, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 18160, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.10483449999999998, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "canonicalModel": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}, "claude-haiku-5-5": {"inputTokens": 16, "outputTokens": 4411, "cacheReadInputTokens": 180445, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 25469, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.007195175, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 554, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "origin": {"kind": "task-notification", "producer": "session-task", "runId": "0mvbecbpj-8630b6f0"}, "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 1, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 1}, "started_in_background": 1, "max_depth": 1, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 1, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "`/api/decks` now leaves out decks with no matches and returns `first_played` for each deck. All six checks from the spec pass. I re-ran them myself and also read the diff, which matches the spec.\n\n- **API:** `decks(conn)` in `meta.py` is one query. A grouped CTE takes the earliest match start per deck, joins onto `v_deck_summary`, and filters on `matches_played > 0`. The ordering is unchanged, and `Deck` has the new `first_played` field.\n- **Frontend:** `versionDays` in `deckOverview.ts` starts from `first_played ?? first_seen`, and its doc comment is updated.\n- **Generated types:** `web/src/types/api.ts` was regenerated with `pnpm --dir web gen:types`. The diff is about 306 lines, not just the new field. The regeneration also picked up the MTGO candidates route and some doc-comment changes that were already in the backend but never regenerated. If you want this change to carry only `first_played`, split that drift into its own commit.\n- **Tests:** The test files weren't touched. `tests/test_api.py` gives 183 passed, and `pnpm --dir web test` passes.\n- **Not run:** The \"Before you finish\" run against a real log with a scratch `--db`, so this isn't checked against real data.\n- **Git:** Nothing is committed.", "ttft_ms": 2353, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 32640, "uuid": "ec4bb7a7-c2d4-4076-8186-0ed138b1eb8c", "ttft_stream_ms": 1150, "time_to_request_ms": 20, "first_content_frame_ms": 1151, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
